Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: secubox-master-link
Architecture: all
Section: oldlibs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-p2p (>= 1.7)
Description: Transitional package — master-link folded into secubox-p2p
 Mesh node enrollment lives inside secubox-p2p (>= 1.7), reachable
 at /master-link/ and /api/v1/p2p/master-link/*. This package ships
 no files. Safe to apt-get autoremove after upgrade.
 .
 Pre-1.1 secubox-master-link installs were never reachable via
 nginx — the standalone service ran on /run/secubox/master-link.sock
 but no nginx config routed to it. Operators saw secubox-p2p's
 master-link UI all along.
 .
 The pre-1.1 state directory at /var/lib/secubox/master-link/ is
 preserved on upgrade so any direct-socket clients can retrieve
 their token/peer data manually. Delete it after migration.
